      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portersville%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The borough sits 15 miles west of Butler and 14 miles east of New Castle, near Butler County’s western edge.",
